@startsalt url-namespace
title HTTP / CalDAV URL namespace
{
{T
+ <b>Path                              | <b>Resource                          | <b>Auth  | <b>Handled by
+ /  and  /health                      | HTML status page                     | no    | StatusPageHandler
+ /health/json                         | JSON health (200 / 503)              | no    | StatusPageHandler
+ /.well-known/caldav                  | 301 redirect to /caldav/             | no    | WellKnownHandler
+ /caldav/                             | Service root (DAV collection)        | yes * | PropFindHandler
++ principals/&#123;user&#125;/                  | Principal                            | yes   | PropFindHandler
++ calendars/&#123;user&#125;/                   | Calendar home                        | yes   | PropFindHandler
+++ tasks/                             | Default calendar (always present)    | yes   | PropFind / Report
++++ donetick-&#123;id&#125;.ics                 | VTODO resource                       | yes   | Get / Put / Delete
++++ &#123;client-uuid&#125;.ics                 | New task from client (PUT)           | yes   | Put (UID map)
+++ &#123;label-slug&#125;/                      | Label calendar (GroupByLabel only)   | yes   | PropFind / Report
++++ donetick-&#123;id&#125;.ics                 | VTODO resource                       | yes   | Get / Put / Delete
}
--
* OPTIONS on any /caldav path is answered without authentication.
}
@endsalt
